        "21．数列的极限的定义"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来比较详细地研究一下前一小节中的第三个例子．“当",
        "$n$充分大时，表达式$y_n=\\frac{n-1}{3n}$的值与$\\frac{1}{3}$的差任意小”，这个论",
        "断的确切含意是什么呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "先提出这样的问题：$n$应当等于多大时，差$y_n-\\frac{1}{3}$的绝对",
        "值小于0.001？因为",
        "$\\left|y_n-\\frac{1}{3}\\right|=\\left|-\\frac{1}{3n}\\right|=\\frac{1}{3n}$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，问题就归结为，求满足不等式",
        "$\\frac{1}{3n}<0.001$",
        "的自然数$n$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
